{"sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","items":[{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k001","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"표준 20개 아미노산은 곁사슬의 전하, 극성, 방향족성, 황 함유 여부 등으로 비교한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k002","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Gly는 가장 작은 R=H이며 비키랄이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k003","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Ala는 methyl, Val·Leu·Ile은 분지형 지방족, Met은 thioether, Pro는 N을 포함하는 고리형 곁사슬이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k004","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Phe·Tyr·Trp는 방향족이고 Tyr의 phenol 및 Trp의 indole은 서로 다른 반응성을 갖는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k005","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Ser와 Thr는 hydroxyl을 가져 인산화 표적이 될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k006","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Cys의 thiol은 이황화결합 및 산화환원 반응에 참여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k007","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Asp/Glu는 carboxylate를 가진 산성 아미노산, Asn/Gln은 amide 곁사슬을 가진 비전하 극성 아미노산이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k008","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Lys는 ε-amino기, Arg는 guanidinium기, His는 imidazole기를 가진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k009","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"His는 생리 pH 부근에서 양성자 이동에 유용하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k010","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"사람의 대표적 필수 아미노산은 His,Ile,Leu,Lys,Met,Phe,Thr,Trp,Val이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k011","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"영양 상태나 성장에 따라 조건부 필수성이 달라질 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k012","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Gly G, Ala A, Val V, Leu L, Ile I, Met M, Pro P.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k013","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Phe F, Tyr Y, Trp W, Ser S, Thr T, Cys C.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k014","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Asp D, Glu E, Asn N, Gln Q, Lys K, Arg R, His H.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k015","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Ser/Thr/Tyr는 대표적 단백질 인산화 잔기이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k016","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Asn과 Gln은 각각 Asp와 Glu의 곁사슬 amide에 대응한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k017","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"3-letter: Gly; 1-letter: G; 명칭: 글라이신; 곁사슬(대표 상태): H; 분류: 비키랄","kind":"table-row","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k018","sectionId":"biomol/amino-acid-details","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"3-letter: Ala; 1-letter: A; 명칭: 알라닌; 곁사슬(대표 상태): CH₃; 분류: 비극성","kind":"table-row","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--amino-acid-details-k019","sectio